# Marker: this directory is an Orbex workspace root.
#
# scripts/lib/workspace.mjs walks up from the current working directory looking for this file,
# so the machinery operates on THIS tree even when the scripts are symlinks into a sibling
# Orbex clone. Without it, Node's symlink resolution would make every script report the
# machinery repo as its root.
#
# Optional settings, `key: value`:
#
#   ecosystem_root: ../some-dir      # the repos the work is actually about
#   ecosystem_doc:  context/arch.md  # linked into ecosystem_root as CLAUDE.md
#
# This repo declares neither: it is a workspace that governs nothing but itself, which is a
# valid state and the one the checks treat as "absent" rather than "broken".
